Homebridge Electrolux Live retains the upstream Apache-2.0 licence and
includes modifications made for this derivative project.

Major planned differences from the upstream project include:

- Electrolux Developer API livestream/SSE state synchronisation.
- Reduced dependence on cached Get Appliance State polling.
- Improved command-state reconciliation.
- Protection against duplicate HomeKit command submission.
- Improved handling of Electrolux command API timeout/HTTP 500 responses.
- Updated Node.js and CI support.
- Additional automated testing and release validation.

The original upstream source used as the starting point is permanently
identified in this repository by the tag:

